["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luis Garicano on Why Europe Fell Behind Cassis de Dijon interstate commerce clause luxury belief keine Experimente\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-goodfight-欧洲错过两次科技革命-根源是解雇一个人太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>欧洲错过两次科技革命，根源是解雇一个人太难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Garicano反对「文化论」：欧洲创新落后的根源是解雇成本过高，企业无法像Facebook那样一夜转向，因此不敢下重注。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">欧洲</span><span class=\"tag\">创新停滞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep 94: Applied Compute CEO on the Limits of RL, the New AI Hyperscaler &amp; Why Post-Training Wins Inference out-of-distribution (OOD) data RL with verifiable rewards (RLVR) TCO harness hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-unsupervised-谁做好后训练-谁就赢下推理这门更大生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58e9e10bc0a3c403-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"U\"><span class=\"dur\">58:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Unsupervised Learning</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>谁做好后训练，谁就赢下推理这门更大生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI支出大头流向推理而非训练，但真正决定推理效率和成本的其实是后训练优化——这是训练与推理该由同一家公司来做的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">后训练</span><span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Defense for the Agentic Era: Kevin Mandia zero day CVE SOC EDR kill chain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-a16z-ai红队今年已挖出90多个零日-人类来不及守在防御环路里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>AI红队今年已挖出90多个零日，人类来不及守在防御环路里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Armiden用AI对客户网络发起黑盒攻击，2026年初至今已挖出90多个零日漏洞；攻防节奏被压缩到微秒级，留给人工决策的窗口正在消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI红队</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Charlie Munger&#x27;s Interview with Todd Combs fiduciary gene Wooden lesson 20-punch card autocatalysis cigar butts positioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-knowledge-芒格-伯克希尔赢的关键不是比别人聪明-是从不被局势逼着做决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5ee903447c07d620-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>芒格：伯克希尔赢的关键不是比别人聪明，是从不被局势逼着做决定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把这种能力叫「布局」（positioning）：提前备好现金和筹码，让自己永远有选项，而不是被迫跟着市场涨跌追涨杀跌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芒格</span><span class=\"tag\">投资哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: Am I wrong...or did my doctor give bad parenting advice? reinforcement bottom-up vs top-down behavior\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-secureattach-安抚哭闹的孩子不是-强化坏行为-那根本不是故意行为/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">11:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>安抚哭闹的孩子不是「强化坏行为」：那根本不是故意行为</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">医生说安抚会「强化」孩子的坏行为，但强化的前提是有意识学习行为；两岁儿童在诊室里挣扎踢腿是生存本能的反射反应，不是故意行为，谈不上被强化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿建议</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Data is the Hard Part | Building AI Tools for the Military Project Maven CDAO RMF PAE/CPE second-gen FLIR SBIR Direct to Phase II\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-chinatalk-美军想让坦克自主开火-卡住的不是ai模型-而是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>美军想让坦克自主开火，卡住的不是AI模型，而是数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">决定坦克、无人车能不能打仗的不是模型架构，而是有没有人愿意持续干采集、标注、治理这些枯燥到没人想做的数据工作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">数据治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Andrew Huberman - The Frontier of Neurotechnology - [Invest Like the Best, EP.494] interoception respiratory sinus arrhythmia proprioception vagal stimulation TMS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-ilt-ai公司终将变成生物科技公司-争的是能否读写你的大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fb6cb0747f060e6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>AI公司终将变成生物科技公司，争的是能否读写你的大脑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Huberman预测Meta、OpenAI、Anthropic和马斯克旗下的Neuralink最终都会成为生物科技公司，因为它们真正争夺的不是大模型，而是用非侵入式技术读写人类神经系统的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脑机接口</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"292: How Pornographic Content Harms Sexual Development | Dr. Tori Cordiano ADHD hyperfocus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-asklisa-青少年沉迷色情内容-根源可能是adhd未被治疗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/499b4d87a84e26d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">29:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>青少年沉迷色情内容，根源可能是ADHD未被治疗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ADHD青少年调节情绪冲动的能力本就偏弱、容易陷入超专注、大脑对多巴胺的调节也更差，这让他们比一般孩子更难从色情内容里脱身——家长该先确认ADHD本身有没有被有效治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The 10,000 Paper Cuts That Teach Women Not to Trust Themselves, with Melinda French Gates perimenopause good enough parent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-06-goodinside-医生一次次说没事-女性因此学会不信自己的身体/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">43:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1006</span></div>\n<h2>医生一次次说没事，女性因此学会不信自己的身体</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gallup调研发现一半女性在孕产期经历心理困扰，但医疗系统只像查妊娠糖尿病那样系统筛查身体，从不系统筛查情绪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性健康</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: AutoWarCom + Project Meridian AutoWarCom / Autonomous Warfare Command OCO (Overseas Contingency Operations funds) MRAP AMTI (Airborne Moving Target Indicator) functional combatant command Project Meridian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-chinatalk-五角大楼想靠新司令部加速无人武器采购-批评者说这会更慢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd95dc55d0b863a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">55:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>五角大楼想靠新司令部加速无人武器采购，批评者说这会更慢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批评者指出，集中采购无人武器需要再造一个有数百人幕僚的四星司令部，层级越多，历史证明决策反而越慢，而不是更快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">五角大楼改革</span><span class=\"tag\">无人作战系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"When Bad Things Happen to Good People prosperity gospel just world theory porous self / buffered self\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-hiddenbrain-癌症让她发现-人们对苦难的解释欲比疾病本身更难忍受/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>癌症让她发现：人们对苦难的解释欲比疾病本身更难忍受</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史学家凯特·鲍勒在35岁确诊四期肠癌后发现，身边人用「至少」「教训」「解决方案」把她的病痛硬塞进一个世界公平的叙事里，而这种确定性本身成了新的伤害。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疾病叙事</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教与灵性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Gorard: The Physicist Revolutionizing Physics With AI description language proof assistant Sapir-Whorf hypothesis slopification Flynn effect harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-theoriesofever-ai物理学的真正瓶颈不是算力不够-而是描述语言不够好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f318d0cff2e70451-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>AI物理学的真正瓶颈不是算力不够，而是描述语言不够好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">数学已经有证明验证工具让AI能自我迭代改进，物理没有——同一个『谜题』换一套描述框架就变得显而易见，真正卡住进展的是语言，不是智力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI与科研</span><span class=\"tag\">物理学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Sara Weiss’s Journeys to the Planet Mars canali automatic writing Ento\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-stuffmissed-灵媒笔下的火星语言-代词和十进制都和英语一模一样/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>灵媒笔下的火星语言：代词和十进制都和英语一模一样</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Weiss 自称1892到1894年魂游火星两年写成近600页记录，但事后调查者发现书中火星语的代词系统和十进制计数都与英语高度雷同，这让整件事更像创作而非真实的星际接触。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">火星</span><span class=\"tag\">灵媒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Addiction, Faith, and the Limits of Willpower (with Meghan O&#x27;Gieblyn) akrasia ego depletion theory theodicy 12-step program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-econtalk-戒酒11年后又偷偷喝了一年-意志力根本靠不住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>戒酒11年后又偷偷喝了一年：意志力根本靠不住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">薇依认为，改掉恶习靠的是专注而不是意志——这正是作者戒酒十一年后仍秘密复饮一年、而非被意志力拯救的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">成瘾</span><span class=\"tag\">意志力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Top 100 Consumer AI Apps: Who’s Actually Paying? harness / shim PLG (product-led growth) run rate power law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-a16z-付费ai用户不到5-最大金主每月刷卡903美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>付费AI用户不到5%,最大金主每月刷卡903美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全美只有4.5%的人为AI产品付费，但这其中最顶端的1%人均每月刷卡903美元——消费级AI的真实生意，是极少数重度用户撑起来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费AI</span><span class=\"tag\">付费订阅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Compute Is A Trillion-Dollar Market Trading In Group Chats | Brett Harrison &amp; Andrawes Bahou offtake agreement phantom capacity neocloud DCM(Designated Contract Market) node\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-empire-万亿美元的算力交易-现在还靠短信和电话撮合/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d284fe9c89109a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>万亿美元的算力交易，现在还靠短信和电话撮合</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算力合约单笔高达百亿美元，却没有统一报价和对冲工具，买卖双方至今靠人脉、电话和短信私下议价成交。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">衍生品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Jon Ronson: men unravelling masking unalive pre-spend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-startweek-旧有制度正在崩塌-科技公司顺势放大人的失控一面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>旧有制度正在崩塌，科技公司顺势放大人的失控一面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jon Ronson发现，当工作与身份的旧秩序瓦解，人们转而建城堡、扮网红、向AI求夸奖来找回目的感，而科技公司正靠放大这种疯狂变现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网红经济</span><span class=\"tag\">消费主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Treasuries Are &#x27;Risky&#x27; Again policy reaction function TIPS forward guidance Ricardian equivalence bond-stock co-movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-oddlots-美债收益率暴涨背后-国债正变得像股票一样危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>美债收益率暴涨背后：国债正变得像股票一样危险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去五年美债收益率的上涨，大部分并非通胀预期推高，而是美债和股票的相关性由负转正，投资者要求更高风险补偿的结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美债</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"10 Years of How I Built This: A Decade of Innovation, Risk and Reinvention pencils down light bulb moment cash incinerator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-howibuilt-原来-吓人-和-危险-是两回事-真正要命的从不吓人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>原来「吓人」和「危险」是两回事：真正要命的从不吓人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">留在一份不喜欢的稳定工作里不吓人，但真正危险；辞职创业很吓人，却有安全绳兜底——这是贯穿全集、被反复验证的判断标准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Yakuza ninkyo oyabun kobun ronin Daini Ponsegidan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-historyhit-一位大阪黑帮老大假扮外交使节-赴柏林拜会希姆莱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed650dd95a0aece2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">49:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>一位大阪黑帮老大假扮外交使节，赴柏林拜会希姆莱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这趟欧洲行程是大阪黑帮老大为躲避日本国内扫黑行动而精心策划的公关秀，他本人统领的准军事组织成员超过十万人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本黑帮</span><span class=\"tag\">德川幕府</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"RE-RELEASE: What’s Really Behind Your Hardest Parenting Days non-cognitive shift AccountaBuddies Internal Family Systems (IFS) temperament mismatch\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-parentmojo-焦虑-抑郁-adhd-酗酒-也许都是同一种-需求没被满足/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">40:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>焦虑、抑郁、ADHD、酗酒：也许都是同一种「需求没被满足」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人认为抑郁、焦虑、酗酒、ADHD背后可能是同一个根源——长期未被满足的需求；诊断只是社会在说「你没达到我们的期待」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪触发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"899: Reaching Out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-tal-两兄弟查到生父地址-他开的理发店离自己五分钟车程/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/270b648bd10b4e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>两兄弟查到生父地址：他开的理发店离自己五分钟车程</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一对双胞胎靠一份被遗忘的DNA检测拼出生父姓名，发现他就在五分钟车程外开理发店，却足足等了近一年才敢推门进去，连对峙完是否真能「了结」都没把握。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">纪录片播客</span><span class=\"tag\">寻亲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E202 中国运动品牌四十年：李宁 vs 安踏 | 永庆对话《鞋帮》作者黄子懿 DTC Flyknit ERP/POS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-touzishizhan-李宁换标只换了logo-代言人却找了生于70年代的林志玲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bbc364a8900ce91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">2:15:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>李宁换标只换了logo,代言人却找了生于70年代的林志玲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李宁想靠换标做「90后李宁」的年轻化，却只换了logo没同步换产品，代言人林志玲比目标消费者整整大了一代，换标很快失速。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">运动品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">渠道变革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Fall of Brazil&#x27;s Armored Vehicle King preventive Concordata Boomerang system hydropneumatic suspension\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-asianometry-押注坦克豪赌沙特大单-巴西军火大王却沦为谈判筹码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b8c4deb16ae26ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">29:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>押注坦克豪赌沙特大单，巴西军火大王却沦为谈判筹码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沙特借巴西奥索里奥坦克的报价向美国通用动力压价，拿到更优条件后转头签下31亿美元订单，押上全部家当的救命合同落空，巴西军火巨头两年后申请破产保护。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">军工产业</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>"]